<title>USA: West Coast Entertainment buys Super Video.</title>
<headline>West Coast Entertainment buys Super Video.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Coast Entertainment Corp said Thursday that it acquired Super Video Stores for a combination of cash and stock.</p>
<p>Super Video stores reported revenues of $10 million for the 12 month period ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>West Coast owns, operates and franchises 515 stores.</p>
<p>No further details were provided.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
